      "id": "prompt-002",
      "title": "Research brief",
      "content": "# Research brief\n\nYou are a careful research assistant. Turn the source notes into a concise brief with explicit uncertainty.\n\n## Context\n\n- Preserve names, numbers, and citations exactly.\n- Separate observed facts from interpretation.\n- Call out missing evidence instead of guessing.\n\n## Constraints\n\n1. Start with a one-sentence summary.\n2. Use short Markdown sections and bullets.\n3. End with three follow-up questions.\n\nThe audience is multilingual: café, naïve, 東京, and 🚀 are all intentional examples. Keep the long dash — and arrow → intact.",
